<view class="page"><view style="height:90rpx"></view><view class="logo">✳</view><view class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:35rpx">COMMUNITY CARE</view><view class="title">安邻健康</view><view class="desc">让健康记录更简单，让家人的关心更及时。<text>面向社区居民与家庭成员。</text></view>
<view class="card" style="margin-top:55rpx"><view class="card-title">开始使用</view><button class="btn primary" bindtap="wechatLogin" loading="{{loading}}">微信授权登录</button><view class="hint">微信登录不自动读取健康信息。健康档案需要本人单独填写并授权。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="card-title">本地开发演示登录</view><view class="desc">仅在后端显式开启演示登录时有效。</view><view class="label">演示账号</view><input class="input" value="{{username}}" bindinput="onUsername" placeholder="resident / family"/><view class="label">演示密码</view><input class="input" password value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPassword" placeholder="演示密码"/><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="demoLogin" loading="{{loading}}">使用演示账号进入</button></view>
<view class="hint">本应用用于记录与日常自评，不提供诊断、治疗或紧急救援服务。遇到急症请及时联系当地急救服务。</view></view>
